{"node_id": "nd001", "text": "Awareness of societal issues", "depth": 1, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks. Just been thinking about all the people who don't have basics we take for granted.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Last week, I saw a report about kids walking miles for clean water.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 67}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T210040Z", "last_updated_at": "20261002T210201Z", "first_seen_session": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "Emotional processing of societal issues", "depth": 2, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.85, "confidence_raw": 0.85, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Feels...odd.", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks. Just been thinking about all the people who don't have basics we take for granted.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 96}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's like I should be happy, but I can't shake this feeling of wanting to do more.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 82}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Feels like I should do more for others.", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 88}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Grateful for what I have, but it’s hard not to think about those in need.", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 109}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Thinking about others without such basics makes me realize how lucky I am. But it’s hard not to feel guilty.", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 181}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things feel... a bit like a seesaw. Grateful for what I have, but it’s hard not to think about those in need.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 109}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T210040Z", "last_updated_at": "20261002T210723Z", "first_seen_session": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "Seeking validation or understanding", "depth": 3, "parent_id": null, "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.6, "confidence_raw": 0.6, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's like I should be happy, but I can't shake this feeling of wanting to do more.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 82}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Yeah, I guess it's a mix of gratitude and guilt. Feels like I should do more for others.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 88}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things feel... a bit like a seesaw. Grateful for what I have, but it’s hard not to think about those in need.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 109}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "The gratitude is about little things, like good weather and a warm meal. Thinking about others without such basics makes me realize how lucky I am. But it’s hard not to feel guilty.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 181}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Thanks for understanding.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"session_id": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Sometimes I worry that feeling grateful takes away from the struggles of others.", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 106}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T210040Z", "last_updated_at": "20261002T210723Z", "first_seen_session": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000163-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
